data/cmaps.bin — predefined CJK CMap tables

This file is a compact, preprocessed derivative of the Adobe CMap resources
(the Adobe-Japan1, Adobe-GB1, Adobe-CNS1, Adobe-Korea1, Adobe-Japan2 and
Adobe-KR predefined CMaps), produced by test/gen-cmap-data.py from the public
cmap-resources project:

    https://github.com/adobe-type-tools/cmap-resources

Only the data folio needs is retained per CMap: the codespace ranges, the
code->CID mappings (cidrange + cidchar), the /WMode flag and the usecmap parent
name.  No PostScript program text is kept.

